      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CAWBOURNE ZARA (1) was midfield throughout and finished there last time when 4th (30.15) at Gosford. Has a good record here at this journey. Good beginner assisted by the inside draw. Can discover winning form. MONSOON ETHICS (7) sprung the lids and led but ran over and filled the minor money when third (30.14) at Gosford in Grade 5. Has failed to finish in the placings from two starts here. Will give a great sight again. SPRING LAYLA (2) has gone well at her last couple of runs here, most recently when third beaten 5.5 lengths (30.47). Yet to win here but has run some good races including two placings. Hard to beat again. STAND UP TONY (6) can feature with the right run.",
